Text Preview: Title: Tell me about Luděk

Description: Luděk's main work is Drupal development. His passions are cybersecurity and GenAI. He has been formally educated in biology, sociology, adult education, and psychology. Although he never studied IT in a formal school, he is a big fan of lifelong learning. He is the creator and maintainer of Drupal modules and started building his first Drupal websites 13 years ago. He has developed solutions for importing images from photo stocks into Drupal, as well as several AI API connectors for Drupal. He can write GitLab pipelines and OpenTofu scripts for AWS and has experience in creating and deploying Docker images. He is now focused on developing custom RAG chatbot. It also serves as a way for him to learn Python and LLM engineering.

Key Competences:
- More than 13 years experience with Drupal
- Development of custom and contrib modules
- LLM integrations and RAG
- AWS Developer associate
- ECS, EC2, RDS, S3, Lambda, EventBridge, StepFunctions, Redis, OpenSearch, CloudFront, IAM, SecretManager
- API integration
- Docker images development
- CI/CD pipelines
- CloudFormation, Terraform/OpenTofu...
